{"id":"o771325cyqcm624qz3dfpoo1v","title":"微软发布 .NET 11 运行时重大更新","originalTitle":"What's new in the .NET 11 runtime","summary":"微软发布 .NET 11 运行时，硬件要求从 x86-64-v1 升级至 x86-64-v3（新增 AVX、BMI 等指令集支持），并引入 Runtime Async V2（减少13帧到5帧的调试堆栈）。新增支持超过1024核处理器，优化了 WebAssembly 调试和 SIMD 控制能力。","reason":"硬件要求提升与运行时异步优化显著降低开发调试成本，同时支持超过1024核处理器，适用于高性能计算场景。","source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/whats-new/dotnet-11/runtime"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T12:20:07.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T14:00:21.996Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T14:00:21.996Z","category":"languages-runtime","tags":["版本发布","性能提升","架构重构"],"score":79,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"02c606fd-7943-4ea5-817b-f6dd59b9dffc","title":"微软发布.NET 11运行时，升级硬件要求与性能优化"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"02c606fd-7943-4ea5-817b-f6dd59b9dffc","title":"微软发布.NET 11运行时，升级硬件要求与性能优化"}],"topics":[{"slug":"major-release","name":"重大版本发布"},{"slug":"performance","name":"性能与基准"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f5kJE8qBvoBI","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}